{"@context":{"lean":"lean:","block":"block:","imports":{"@type":"@id"}},"@graph":[{"@id":"lean:module:QOU.ParticleInteractions.deuterium_derived_binding","@type":"LeanModule","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.deuterium_derived_binding","imports":["lean:module:Init","lean:module:Mathlib.Tactic","lean:module:Mathlib.Data.Real.Basic"],"declarations":41,"chunks":1},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_binding_prefactor_deuteron","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_binding_prefactor_deuteron","kind":"theorem","line":180,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L180-L188","doc":"Deuteron specialization: when the binding link has Borromean\nvolume (Vol(K_bind) = Vol(𝓑_3)), the two endomorphisms share the\nidentical `m_e · Vol(𝓑_3)` prefactor. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_binding_share_prefactor","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.mass_binding_share_prefactor","kind":"theorem","line":161,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L161-L178","doc":"The mass and binding endomorphisms share the same structural\ntemplate: stripping the structural factor (lw/ℏ_q² for mass,\nΔtr for binding) leaves `m_e · Vol(·)` — the Borromean volume on\nthe mass side, the binding-link volume on the binding side.\n\nFor the **deuteron** these coincide (Vol(K_bind) = Vol(𝓑_3) = 8G,\nthe Hopf inter-nucleon link being Seifert-fibred), so both\nprefactors equal `m_e · Vol(𝓑_3)`; for A≥3 they differ by the\nbinding-link volume ratio. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.binding_shape","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.binding_shape","kind":"theorem","line":159,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L159-L159","doc":"Binding endomorphism shape (general binding-link volume). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.mass_shape","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.mass_shape","kind":"theorem","line":157,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L157-L157","doc":"Mass endomorphism shape (always Borromean Vol_B3). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.delta_tr_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.delta_tr_ne","kind":"theorem","line":155,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L155-L155","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.lw_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.lw_ne","kind":"theorem","line":154,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L154-L154","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.hbar_q_sq_ne","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.hbar_q_sq_ne","kind":"theorem","line":153,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L153-L153","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.B_pred","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.B_pred","kind":"def","line":152,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L152-L152","doc":"Predicted binding energy. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.m_pred","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.m_pred","kind":"def","line":150,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L150-L150","doc":"Predicted nucleon mass. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.delta_tr","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.delta_tr","kind":"def","line":148,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L148-L148","doc":"Trace difference Δtr = |tr_free| − |tr_atom|. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.lw","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.lw","kind":"def","line":146,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L146-L146","doc":"Mass linking weight lw(K, q_0). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.hbar_q_sq","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.hbar_q_sq","kind":"def","line":144,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L144-L144","doc":"Substrate ℏ_q² appearing in the mass formula denominator. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.Vol_Kbind","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.Vol_Kbind","kind":"def","line":142,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L142-L142","doc":"Binding-link volume Vol(K_bind) (binding side — atom-specific:\nHopf for ²H, 8₁₁-class for ³H, L6a4 for ³He). For the deuteron\nthis equals Vol(𝓑_3); for A≥3 it differs. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.Vol_B3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.Vol_B3","kind":"def","line":138,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L138-L138","doc":"Borromean volume Vol(𝓑_3) = 8G (mass side — nucleons are Borromean). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.m_e","kind":"def","line":136,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L136-L136","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy.mk","kind":"ctor","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L135-L135","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.BindingEndomorphismAnalogy","kind":"class","line":135,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L135-L159","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.deuterium_derived_binding","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.deuterium_derived_binding","kind":"def","line":67,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L67-L115","doc":"**Proposition statement** (from manuscript):\n\nLet $\\mathrm{NF}(\\mathfrak{p})$ and $\\mathrm{NF}(\\mathfrak{n})$\nbe the [proton](#def:categorical-proton) and\n[neutron](#def:categorical-neutron) normal forms in $H_3(q)$,\neach constructed as $\\mathcal{B}_3 \\cdot \\mathrm{crossings}(quarks)$\n([confinement selection](#prop:confinement-operator-selection))\nwith $\\mathcal{B}_3 = \\sigma_0\\sigma_1\\sigma_2\\sigma_0\\sigma_1\\sigma_2$.\nThe full canonical deuteron braid word\n$\\beta_D = \\mathtt{atom\\_braid\\_word\\_3A}(1, 1) \\in H_6(q)$\n([`mass_at_3A_proper.atom_braid_word_3A`](https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/main/computations/mass_at_3A_proper.py))\nfactors as $\\mathrm{NF}(\\mathfrak{p}) \\cdot T_{pn} \\cdot \\mathrm{NF}(\\mathfrak{n})$\nunder the H_3 → H_6 Hecke embedding, where\n$T_{pn} = \\frac{1}{2}(\\sigma_0 + \\sigma_0^{-1})$ is the time-reversal\nsymmetric crossing operator at the inter-nucleon site (the unique\ngenerator of $\\beta_D$ that crosses a proton strand with a neutron\nstrand). Then the deuterium binding energy is*\n\n$$\n  B(d) = \\bigl[\\mathrm{tr}_M(\\mathfrak{p})\n       + \\mathrm{tr}_M(\\mathfrak{n})\n       - \\mathrm{tr}_M(T_{pn} \\cdot \\mathfrak{n})\\bigr]\n       \\times m_e \\cdot \\mathrm{Vol}(\\mathcal{B}_3)\n       \\times (1 - \\alpha_{\\mathrm{EM}}/2).\n$$\n\n## Derivation\n\nDeuterium has exactly one inter-nucleon crossing site (the $p$-$n$\npair).\n\n    The Lean encoding **names** the conditional conjecture as a `Prop`\n    (pattern C of the vacuity-fix playbook): the context class is the\n    carrier of the deuteron-binding-pipeline data, and\n    `deuterium_derived_binding` is the proposition that the six\n    manuscript sub-claims hold for that data.  It is *not* asserted\n    (no `theorem … := ⟨ctx.claim_*⟩` self-assuming projection); a\n    discharging instance is the open conditional claim. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.B_exp","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.B_exp","kind":"def","line":65,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L65-L65","doc":"CODATA deuteron binding energy `B_exp = 2.2246 MeV`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.T_pn","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.T_pn","kind":"def","line":63,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L63-L63","doc":"The time-reversal-symmetric inter-nucleon operator `T_pn`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.sigma_0_inv","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.sigma_0_inv","kind":"def","line":61,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L61-L61","doc":"Inverse Hecke generator `σ_0⁻¹`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.sigma_0","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.sigma_0","kind":"def","line":59,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L59-L59","doc":"Inter-nucleon Hecke generator value `σ_0`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.h6_strand_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.h6_strand_count","kind":"def","line":57,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L57-L57","doc":"Strand count of the H_6 target algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.h3_strand_count","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.h3_strand_count","kind":"def","line":55,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L55-L55","doc":"Strand count of the H_3 source algebra. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.braid_length_B3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.braid_length_B3","kind":"def","line":53,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L53-L53","doc":"Length of the Borromean baryon braid word `𝓑_3 = σ_0σ_1σ_2σ_0σ_1σ_2`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.NF_n_braid_word","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.NF_n_braid_word","kind":"def","line":51,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L51-L51","doc":"Neutron NF braid word in `H_3(q)`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.NF_p_braid_word","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.NF_p_braid_word","kind":"def","line":49,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L49-L49","doc":"Proton NF braid word in `H_3(q)` (encoded as a `List ℤ` of\nHecke-generator indices; negatives denote inverses). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.tr_M_Tpn_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.tr_M_Tpn_n","kind":"def","line":46,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L46-L46","doc":"The Markov-trace evaluation `tr_M(T_pn · n) : ℝ` of the\ninter-nucleon-coupled neutron. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.tr_M_n","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.tr_M_n","kind":"def","line":43,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L43-L43","doc":"The Markov-trace evaluation `tr_M(n) : ℝ` of the neutron NF. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.tr_M_p","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.tr_M_p","kind":"def","line":41,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L41-L41","doc":"The Markov-trace evaluation `tr_M(p) : ℝ` of the proton NF. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.B_d","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.B_d","kind":"def","line":39,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L39-L39","doc":"The deuterium binding energy `B(d) : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.α_EM","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.α_EM","kind":"def","line":37,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L37-L37","doc":"Fine-structure constant `α_EM`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.Vol_B3","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.Vol_B3","kind":"def","line":35,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L35-L35","doc":"Borromean baryon volume `Vol(𝓑_3) ≈ 7.32772`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.m_e","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.m_e","kind":"def","line":33,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L33-L33","doc":"Electron mass `m_e : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.q","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.q","kind":"def","line":31,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L31-L31","doc":"The substrate parameter `q : ℝ`. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.HeckeAlgebra","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.HeckeAlgebra","kind":"def","line":29,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L29-L29","doc":"Hecke algebra type `H_n(q)` indexed by strand count. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.Braid","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.Braid","kind":"def","line":27,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L27-L27","doc":"The braid representative type. ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.N","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.N","kind":"def","line":25,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L25-L25","doc":"Neutron number `N` (always 1 for deuterium). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.Z","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.Z","kind":"def","line":23,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L23-L23","doc":"Proton number `Z` (always 1 for deuterium). ","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.mk","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext.mk","kind":"ctor","line":21,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L21-L21","signatureChunk":0},{"@id":"lean:QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext","@type":"LeanDeclaration","name":"QOU.ParticleInteractions.DeuteriumDerivedBindingContext","kind":"class","line":16,"sourceLink":"https://github.com/litlfred/qou/blob/7341d18daa5d103cc9fa41bebdf054eda96ad3d7/folio/quantum-observable-universe/lean/QOU/ParticleInteractions/deuterium_derived_binding.lean#L16-L65","doc":"Abstract context for the `deuterium_derived_binding` claim —\nmanuscript-themed typed fields below; sub-claims encode the\ndeuteron-binding pipeline (proton/neutron NF construction →\nHecke embedding → factorisation → T_pn definition → binding-\nenergy formula → numerical match). ","signatureChunk":0}